<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Energy says Unocal farms into Brunei.</title>
<headline>FCL Energy says Unocal farms into Brunei.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Energy confirmed on Tuesday that the party which has farmed into Blocks A and CD Petroleum Mining Agreements in offshore Brunei is Unocal Borneo Utara Ltd, a subsidiary of Unocal California.</p>
</text>
